  "content": "<p>模组由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 创作 - \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">领英</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">谷歌学术</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p><h3>动态村庄（Dynamic Village）是机械动力（Create）的扩展模组，为原版村庄新增了多种与机械动力相关的职业与建筑。<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x2n2cv6/starongithub.png\" alt=\"星标\"></a></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/sudolev/DynamicVillageMod/assets/61996958/40b915c2-4707-4376-a1c0-5ec6a5a55bcc\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><h1>功能列表</h1><p><strong>机械工程师</strong></p><ul>\n<li>收购与出售机械动力模组中的机械装置部件</li>\n<li>核心方块：蓝图桌</li>\n</ul><p><strong>流体工程师</strong></p><ul>\n<li>收购与出售机械动力模组中的流体管理部件——管道、泵、潜水装备等</li>\n<li>核心方块：物品排水口</li>\n</ul><p><strong>列车机械师</strong></p><ul>\n<li>收购与出售机械动力模组中的列车系统部件</li>\n<li>核心方块：列车站</li>\n</ul><p><strong>矿工</strong></p><ul>\n<li>收购与出售机械动力模组中的采矿设备，以及各类矿物与金属</li>\n<li>核心方块：机械钻头</li>\n</ul><h3>总计20种适用于平原、热带草原、沙漠、针叶林和雪原村庄的建筑</h3><h1>贡献指南</h1><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ben001109/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Ben001109</a> 将动态村庄移植至1.20.1版本！</strong> 🎉</p><h3>报告漏洞、提出建议与创意</h3><p>漏洞报告、建议和创意都非常宝贵且备受感激。通过GitHub提交问题是最佳的联系方式。</p><h3>参与翻译</h3><p>对翻译的帮助深表感谢。最佳方式是通过GitHub提交问题或拉取请求。</p><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/EDGW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@EDGW</a> 将动态村庄翻译为简体中文。</strong> 🎉</p><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/Khaogamermain01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Khao</a> 将动态村庄翻译为泰语。</strong> 🎉</p><p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/RemVan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RemVan</a> 将动态村庄翻译为俄语。</strong> 🎉</p><h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamic-village%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上查找动态村庄</h3><h4>在此处 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">报告问题</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/5srLQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4tvGCgv/dynamicvillage.png\" alt=\"动态村庄横幅\"></a></p>",
